    "0 turns it off, 1 is low, 2 is medium, and 3 is high. \"Turn on my seat heater\" means 3.": {
      "comment": "App Intent or parameter description used by Siri and Shortcuts.",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0 lo apaga, 1 es bajo, 2 medio y 3 alto. «Calentar mi asiento» significa 3."
          }
        }
      }
    },
