    "Applies Tesla controls in one call: climate power, target temperature (°F or °C), defrost, front seat heat, steering wheel, Dog/Bioweapon Mode, locks, Sentry, charging, limit/amps, charge port, windows, trunk/frunk, lights, horn, or destination. Orders steps and confirms sensitive actions. Omit Vehicle for default car; seat cooling and updates use dedicated tools.": {
      "comment": "App Intent or parameter description used by Siri and Shortcuts.",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aplica controles de Tesla en una llamada: clima, temperatura, desempañado, asientos, volante, Modo Perro/Defensa Biológica, seguros, Centinela, carga, puerto, ventanillas, maletero, luces, bocina o destino. Confirma acciones sensibles. Omite Vehículo para el predeterminado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
