      }
    },
    "Only the settings the user asked for; leave the others empty so they stay as they are. For example, \"warm it to 72 and heat my seat\" is 22 °C with driver seat heat 3.": {
      "comment": "App Intent or parameter description used by Siri and Shortcuts.",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Solo los ajustes solicitados; deja el resto vacío para conservarlos sin cambios."
