          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leer notas de la versión de %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read release notes for my car": {
      "comment": "Siri prediction title for reading software release notes for the user's selected car.",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leer notas de la versión de mi vehículo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reads a Tesla vehicle's battery health percentage, estimated degradation percentage, current usable capacity vs original new-pack capacity in kWh, estimated full-charge range at 100%, current energy remaining in kWh, lifetime energy used, phantom drain percentage, and pack voltage and module temperatures.": {
      "comment": "App Intent or parameter description used by Siri and Shortcuts.",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Consulta salud y degradación de la batería del Tesla, capacidad útil frente a nueva, autonomía al 100%, energía restante, consumo en reposo, voltaje y temperaturas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reads a Tesla vehicle's total odometer mileage in miles from the latest live telemetry snapshot. Omit the vehicle parameter to inspect the user's selected car.": {
      "comment": "App Intent or parameter description used by Siri and Shortcuts.",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lee el kilometraje total del odómetro de un Tesla desde la última telemetría. Omite el vehículo para el seleccionado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reads aloud Tesla's release notes about what's new in the car's software: the release notes for the update waiting to install, or for the installed version when there's no update. Can read the notes for a specific version, or only the features about one topic, such as FSD or Navigation.": {
      "comment": "App Intent or parameter description used by Siri and Shortcuts.",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lee las novedades del software de Tesla de la actualización pendiente o de la versión instalada. Permite filtrar por versión o tema como FSD o Navegación."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reads and controls your real Tesla through your selected provider.": {
      "comment": "Explanation of Live mode",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lee y controla tu Tesla real mediante el proveedor seleccionado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reads live data from the user's car (or Tesla) and answers only what was asked: battery, range, tire pressure, mileage, charging, cabin climate, locks and open doors, or where the car is. Pass every topic the user asked about in one call. Returns the requested readings for follow-up questions.": {
      "comment": "App Intent or parameter description used by Siri and Shortcuts.",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lee datos en vivo del Tesla y responde solo lo solicitado: batería, autonomía, neumáticos, kilometraje, carga, clima, seguros o ubicación."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reads your real car's live status, but intercepts and logs every Siri and app command without touching your car.": {
      "comment": "Explanation of Dry-Run mode",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lee el estado real de tu vehículo, pero intercepta y registra cada comando de Siri o la app sin tocar el vehículo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
