    "Shows a card with the user's car (or Tesla) at a glance: battery, range, charging, locks, climate, mileage, and tire pressure. Use for broad requests like \"check my car\", \"how's my car?\", or \"show my Tesla\". For specific readings, use the Get Vehicle Info tool, which answers only what was asked.": {
      "comment": "App Intent or parameter description used by Siri and Shortcuts.",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Muestra una tarjeta general del Tesla: batería, autonomía, carga, seguros, clima, kilometraje y neumáticos. Para datos concretos usa Obtener información del vehículo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Simulates a Model Y for both the app and Siri—no provider sign-in needed. Commands update the demo car locally.": {
      "comment": "Explanation of Demo Car mode",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Simula un Model Y para la app y Siri sin iniciar sesión. Los comandos actualizan el vehículo de prueba localmente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Since Last Charge": {
      "comment": "Display title for stats period since last charge",
      "localizations": {
